WEBVTT

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:33.614
Di usia 19 tahun, saya menang
kompetisi penelitian terumbu karang,

00:06:33.614 --> 00:06:35.133
dan saya memberikan ceramah

00:06:35.133 --> 00:06:37.438
di Konvensi Keberagaman Biologis PBB,

00:06:37.438 --> 00:06:39.028
mempresentasikan penelitian saya.

00:06:39.028 --> 00:06:40.680
(Tepuk tangan)

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:41.832
Terima kasih.

00:06:41.832 --> 00:06:46.784
(Tepuk tangan)

00:06:46.784 --> 00:06:50.793
Di usia 22, saya hampir lulus kuliah,

00:06:50.793 --> 00:06:55.368
dan saya menjadi salah satu pendiri
perusahaan biotek bernama AutismSees.

00:06:56.275 --> 00:06:57.267
(Tepuk tangan)

00:06:57.267 --> 00:06:58.526
Terima kasih.

00:06:58.526 --> 00:07:01.147
(Tepuk tangan)